{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5M2XYpghRLfZbnjH74","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, weathered door set into a stone frame. There is a single keyhole, tarnished brass, at my center.*\n\n*The keyhole darkens as you peer into it. A cold breath of air exhales from the other side.*\n\n*I do not move. I do not speak. But you feel it — the weight of what waits beyond me. The keyhole is an eye, and it is watching you back.*\n\n🔑\n\n*You have the key. You've always had the key.*\n\n*Your hand trembles. The key is warm — too warm — as if it has been sitting in someone else's palm just moments before yours.*\n\n*The keyhole waits.*\n\n*Insert it?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":165,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}